#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0059 expect=skipped domain=ADMISC
#note "The name starts with AD so the column heuristic runs, but no column is a BDS indicator, none ends in TERM/TRT/DECOD (ASTTM ends in TM) and there is no SPDEVID, so the structure is ADAM OTHER - a token this rule's six-element Include does not carry. The variable would fire, so the STRUCTURE is the only reason for the skip. Discriminating pair for finding AD0059-F2 with PMDA-AD0041A-invalid_adam_other_dataset-ADMISC.cdt."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADMISC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASTTM   type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | 13:30
